SUMMARY:“Where I’m Calling From” by Raymond Carver [ONLINE]
DESCRIPTION:Novel Lovers of Sonoma County\, CA\nWe're discussing selection
 s from *The Best American Short Stories of the Century*\, ed. John Updike 
 and Katrina Kenison\, an anthology of BASS short stories from 1915 to 1999
 . Our choices are based on member recommendations. Today's story is “Whe
 re I’m Calling From” by Raymond Carver (1983)\, recommended by Martha.
